
set up python
sudo apt install python3 python3-pip python3-venv

create virtual python environment(protect global lib)
python3 -m venv venv

active virtual python environment
source venv/bin/activate
exit: deactive

install dependencies for this project(farmware simplified)
pip install "fastapi[standard]" sqlalchemy pydantic


install dependencies:
pip install fastapi uvicorn[standard]
pip install "uvicorn[standard]"
这样做的原理是：python3 -m 会强制使用当前虚拟环境里的 Python 解释器来运行 uvicorn 模块。这个 Python 解释器知道虚拟环境的 site-packages 目录，所以能找到 fastapi
before dev the app ->
pip install fastapi uvicorn[standard] sqlalchemy python-dotenv passlib[bcrypt] python-jose[cryptography] pydantic
    use source qing hua to fix souce error:
pip install sqlalchemy passlib[bcrypt] python-jose[cryptography] \
  -i https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple
-OR-
!!!change global source to qing hua !!!
pip config set global.index-url https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple 


Run :
python3 -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
正确的启动方式
永远用 python3 -m uvicorn 而不是直接敲 uvicorn！



